// from; map 1 zones the _on twin as lab dressing, so it is proven to build).
// v14.20-v18.99d it was map 1's ww2_circuit_breaker power-switch model, which
// players read as a power switch and never as a rampage inducer. Both twins:
// _tod_rampage.gsc swaps to _on (lit purple gauge) while the mode is armed.
// v18.99h: the model is the REAL one now. It is
// `t10_zm_essence_container_orange` plus the four crystal shards
// `t10_zm_essence_container_crystal_01..04` that float in its glass
// cylinder, joined into ONE static prop (15 x 15 x 31 in, 7 materials) by
// tools/bo6_extraction/stage_rampage_inducer.py + install_inducer_bo3.py,
// which own source_data/tod_bo6_inducer.gdt and model_export/tod_bo6_inducer/.
//
// ITS ASSET NAME CONTAINS NEITHER "RAMPAGE" NOR "INDUCER" - both return 0 of
// 272,642 loaded BO6 assets and no public datamine names it. It was found by
// searching the FICTION (`kind:model essence`), because the wikis call it "an
// Aetherium essence canister containing fragments of a Fury Crystal".
// v18.99e-g shipped t10_zm_aether_canister, a Liberty Falls hazmat DRUM picked
// on a name match - measured, a constant-radius cylinder with a blue-violet
// gauge glow and no crystal in it at all.
xmodel,tod_inducer
