// [tod] TOWER GAUGE v2 (2026-09-02, files (98).zip, docs/70) — the floor
// indicator. LUI has no UV/crop, so the lit 'climbed' trail is stamped
// cell-by-cell: _dark is the full 180x1440 backing; _c01.._c25 are the LIT
// cells and _d01.._d25 the DOWNED-TEAMMATE cells, each a full-width 180x42
// band cut from the delivery's registered masters by tools/slice_gauge.js
// (one per cell, never a shared tile — the plate's vignette differs per
// row, and each cell carries its DISTRICT colour: blue/green/orange/gold/
// red, lounges 5/10/15/20 on a wider plate); _crown (180x290, the map's
// real gold crown) lights on the roof, _base lights with cell 1, _boss is
// the boss pip beside the boss's cell.
